Package: classicube
Architecture: ppc64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libopenal1
Suggests: classicube-data
Description: ClassiCube block building game
 A Minecraft Classic compatible game (SDL3 window and gamepad, desktop GL 1, OpenAL).
 /usr/games/classicube runs it from a per-user directory (~/.local/share/classicube), where it
 keeps options, maps and screenshots. It does not contain Mojang's textures, sounds and music:
 the game's launcher downloads them on first run, or classicube-data (licensed, a separate
 source package) installs them. See /usr/share/doc/classicube/README.Debian.
